WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.150
- Well, today's show is about boss lady.

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:05.330
So do you have a boss lady
who's inspired you in your life?

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:06.219
- You know what? I,

00:00:06.219 --> 00:00:09.520
I'm still obsessed with Shonda Rhimes.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:12.043
- Did you see Bridgerton.

00:00:12.043 --> 00:00:13.447
- Did I?!

00:00:16.212 --> 00:00:18.280
My friend directed the pilot.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:21.420
And I was like, girl, tell me everything.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.253
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:22.253 --> 00:00:23.413
- Obsessed, Obsessed

00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:25.603
(laughing)

00:00:25.603 --> 00:00:27.410
- It's so good. I love how
she incorporates music.

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:28.358
It's like contemporary,

00:00:28.358 --> 00:00:29.191
- Yeah

00:00:29.191 --> 00:00:30.330
- but she kind of makes it like you know,

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:31.163
- It was great

00:00:31.163 --> 00:00:32.010
- with the orchestra
playing, it was really

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:32.843
really cool

00:00:32.843 --> 00:00:34.751
- Yeah, she was telling me how they were

00:00:34.751 --> 00:00:39.751
how they chose to shoot
those ballroom scenes.

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:43.700
And it was, it was a difficult choice

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:45.250
but they were happy with the way they

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:47.700
how it went because
everything was choreographed.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.760
And so if they had to do a
pickup in the middle of a line

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:52.540
the dancers had to be where they were

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:53.900
in the middle of a line.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:54.930
I mean, they got through it but

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:56.230
- Yeah, it was well done though.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:57.320
I mean, everybody loves it

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.700
and she's a true boss lady
and just building an empire.

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:02.787
Yeah. So, so incredibly gifted.

